communication, relational database management, authentication, input validation, and software testing. The project also highlights the importance of maintaining data integrity, protecting user information, and validating booking requests before storing records. Although advanced features such as payment processing, live supplier reservations, and AI-based recommendations may require additional development, the proposed system provides a foundation for a more comprehensive travel management platform. The final assessment of the project should be based on the implemented features, test results, and evidence collected during development.
